Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:58.54,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 多伦多 WTA1000 第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:58.54,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}萨巴伦卡 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-3 6-4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 张帅 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,it was a tricky match as they all are often
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场球是挺棘手的 每场都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:03.28,EN,,0,0,0,,in different ways, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:03.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是难的地方不同 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:05.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Um you only face two break points
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:05.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今天只面对了两个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:06.08,EN,,0,0,0,,on serve today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:06.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,都在自己的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:07.28,EN,,0,0,0,,One coming in the first set,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:07.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,一个在第一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.28,0:00:08.56,EN,,0,0,0,,one coming right at the end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.28,0:00:08.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,一个就在第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:09.44,EN,,0,0,0,,of the second set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:09.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,快结束的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:10.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Are those ones a bit harder
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种时候是不是更难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:11.36,EN,,0,0,0,,when you're trying to serve it out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:11.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,当你正想发球胜赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:12.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and you face a break point?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,却碰上一个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Are those ones a little bit trickier
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,那样的球是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:14.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to navigate past?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:14.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,更不好处理
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:16.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, that was definitely tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,确实挺棘手的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:18.00,EN,,0,0,0,,She play great. It was it was tough to face
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:18.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,她打得很好 那种球很难接
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:20.16,EN,,0,0,0,,when you want to finish the match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你正想结束这场球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:21.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and go rest and you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:21.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,回去休息 结果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.68,0:00:22.48,EN,,0,0,0,,there's the break point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.68,0:00:22.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,破发点就来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:24.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Of course, that's that's definitely not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:24.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,那当然不轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:25.76,EN,,0,0,0,,And uh um I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:27.44,EN,,0,0,0,,that I managed to, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:27.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己撑住了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:29.68,EN,,0,0,0,,stay stay focused and uh and managed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:29.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,保持住专注 也
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:32.08,EN,,0,0,0,,to close this match in straight sets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,直落两盘收下了这场球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and just finally absolutely packed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后一个问题 今晚这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:34.56,EN,,0,0,0,,in here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:34.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,坐得满满当当
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:35.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Your second night match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:35.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的第二场夜场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:37.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Just a word on the atmosphere here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:37.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,说说这里的气氛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:38.72,EN,,0,0,0,,It's electric, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:38.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,简直点着了 是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:39.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:39.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:41.12,EN,,0,0,0,,it's a really amazing atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:41.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,这气氛真的太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:42.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm I'm I'm glad
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:42.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.40,EN,,0,0,0,,that I'm playing the night night matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己打的是夜场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:48.40,EN,,0,0,0,,It's uh I hope they they'll continue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我希望他们能继续
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:50.08,EN,,0,0,0,,scheduling me for the night matches
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:50.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,把我排在夜场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:52.80,EN,,0,0,0,,because it's uh it's the best to play in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为在你们面前打球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:54.80,EN,,0,0,0,,of you all to enjoy the atmosphere,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:54.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,最棒了 享受这气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:56.00,EN,,0,0,0,,enjoy the support.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:56.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,享受这份支持
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:56.88,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:56.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们是最棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:00:58.54,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:00:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
